<title>TURKEY: Turkish Airlines pay dispute settled.</title>
<headline>Turkish Airlines pay dispute settled.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkey's national carrier Turkish Airlines (THY) on Thursday signed a two-year labour contract with union Hava-Is representing 7,758 company workers, Hava-Is chairman Atilla Aycin said.</p>
<p>&quot;The agreement was signed today,&quot; Aycin told Reuters.</p>
</text>
